Falo de forma de conteúdo!

224
00:18:42,992 --> 00:18:44,658
Falo de inter-relacionamentos!

225
00:18:44,742 --> 00:18:47,617
Falo de Deus, do Diabo, do lnferno, do Céu,

226
00:18:47,742 --> 00:18:49,783
